    "table_title": "Schedule of Activities (SoA)",
    "table_purpose": "ISA BP05 (LY3857210, chronic low back pain) schedule: visits and procedures unique to the ISA, on top of the master CPMP and CLBP DSA CPMP(2) SoAs; prints the screening visits V1-V2 and V3-V7, ED of the master and adds follow-up visit V801",
    "page_start": 11,
    "page_end": 14,
    "notes": "One label column (L=1); data columns at positions 2-10 (V1 -> 2, V2 -> 3, V3 -> 4, V4 -> 5, V5 -> 6, V6 -> 7, V7 -> 8, ED -> 9, V801 -> 10); the right-hand Notes column is not a schedule column. Typed main_soa: every participant in this ISA passes through it in sequence. It is a delta schedule: the intro text says it shows only what is unique to the ISA; footnote a ('Collect in addition to schedule described in the Master Protocol CPMP.') marks eight rows as additions to the master schedule. Section bands 'Scales, Questionnaires, and Outcome Measures' and 'Clinical Laboratory Tests and Sample Collection' group the rows below them. Four redaction bars hide rows; their row positions (19, 34, 37, 38) are unassigned and may each stand for more than one row. p.14 shows only the header and one bar."
  },
